{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「スカイツリー」オープンしましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「東京ソラマチ」「すみだ水族館」には行くつもりですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイツリーのヒメマチ行った？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、東京ソラマチに来てます！ひめたんは行きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイツリー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏休みに行ってみたいね(´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ人多いかなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイツリーといえば。東京タワーにまつわるお話!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京タワーっていつもオレンジじゃないって知っていましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今夜はブルー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日によって色が違う時があるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん家は夜帰ってくると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玄関を入る前に綺麗な東京タワーが見えるのね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある日レッスンが終わって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままと妹と待ち合わせて東京タワーに行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこの時間は消灯してるだろうなって思いつつも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、一度消えた照明がまたつくことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにあるって聞いたことあったから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤羽橋駅を降りたらやっぱり消灯してたのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんか近くに行ってみたいねって3人で歩いてたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガソリンスタンドの角を曲がった瞬間、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消えていたはずの東京タワーが点灯してたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"点灯の瞬間は見逃してしまったけど、オレンジ色の光景をみてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか元気になった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰って調べたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり一度消灯したあとに不定期で再点灯することがあるんだってー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも運試ししてみては？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つづきー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６として、消費税増税についてどう思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごはんの消費税はこらえるから、ＣＤは免税にしてほすいよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごはんの量考えてから買うきっかけになってみんな健康なるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＣＤは...ＣＤはだめよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"増税したって何のメリットもないじゃん(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボイトレってどんな事するの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は発声や姿勢矯正、何曲も続けて歌いながら踊るって感じかな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌う体力つけてかなきゃね。アイドルだもーんぬ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3rdの個握まであえないのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"９月の個握まで会えないとかひめたん耐えれんわー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休みはいろんなイベントがあるんじゃないかなーとひとりで期待してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはディズニーのアトラクションで何が一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーは小２以来行ってないから記憶にないのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランド内だったらスプラッシュマウンテン、カリブ好きー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏に食べたいものって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイス、かき氷、BBQもしたいー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっ(・o・ノ)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏っていっちゃん痩せると思ってたけど、意外と危険なのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でも美味しい時期だもんねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいもんつられないもんー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多くの人が可愛いと思わないものを可愛いと思うのはどうなんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"異常なのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーそんなことはないと思う(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂さんなんかいっぱいいて好みも全然違うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういやあんま気にしたことないなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46番コメ返貼りたいとこなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか一気におっきい画像２枚貼れないみたいなのね(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、最近写めないから、写め貼りたいなーと思ったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメ返は次回まとめて貼ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちょっとまっててね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ちっちゃくなっちゃった浴衣どん＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/0118184/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}